//    page says 4 + 2, their own technical specification sheet says 6 + 2. Both
//    are official, so both are published here, each attributed to the document
//    it came from, and neither is quietly picked. Rendered from
//    channelsProductPage and channelsSpecSheet.
//
// DVS IS NOT DOCUMENTED for this mixer, and the Xone:96's Traktor Scratch
// certification is NOT carried across. Nothing published, so nothing claimed
